{comment: Intro}
| [Dm] | ×18

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Shuthelah walked with his son
Bered stood [C]in the line
Ta[Bb]hath kept [C]the co[Am]venant
The blood [Bb]of Ep[C]hraim divine
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Tahath son of [C]Bered
Elea[Bb]dah came af[C]ter you
[Dm]The name returns [C]again
In the house [Bb]of Jo[C]seph true
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
The son of [C]Eleadah
[Dm]Tahath once more [C]stands
Within the tribe [Bb]of Ep[C]hraim
Where the [Am]patriarchs com[Bb]manded
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[C]Tahath son [Dm]of Bered
E[C]leadah came af[Bb]ter you
The [C]name re[Dm]turns again
In [C]the house of Joseph [Bb]true
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
De[C]scendants of Ephraim
The line continues [C][Dm]on
{end_of_verse}

